First up, we have a plethora of skills distributed across so many repositories

81
00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:12.800
that's become incredibly difficult and almost impossible to get your head

82
00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:13.480
wrapped around.

83
00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:18.120
How to unify, centralize, and properly distribute skills across all teams.

